{"abstract":"In accordance with the Tariff Act of 1930, as amended (the Act), the Department of Commerce (Commerce) is automatically initiating the five-year reviews (Sunset Reviews) of the antidumping and countervailing duty (AD/CVD) order(s) and suspended investigation(s) listed below. The International Trade Commission (the ITC) is publishing concurrently with this notice its notice of Institution of Five-Year Reviews which covers the same order(s) and suspended investigation(s).","action":null,"agencies":[{"id":54,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","name":"Commerce Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","slug":"commerce-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department"},{"id":261,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/261","name":"International Trade Administration","parent_id":54,"raw_name":"International Trade Administration","slug":"international-trade-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/international-trade-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06923.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19069","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Applicable April 1, 2022.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06923","effective_on":null,"end_page":19070,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06923.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06923/initiation-of-five-year-sunset-reviews","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06923?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06923/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":